#: .\analytics\models.py:133
msgid "刻意減量休息，體能與專項水準本來就會回落"
msgstr "A deliberate period of reduced load, so fitness and event-specific form naturally drop back"

#: .\analytics\models.py:134
msgid "這段期間的數字不代表能力，別跟賽季的成績直接比。"
msgstr "Numbers from this period do not reflect ability; do not compare them straight against in-season marks."

#: .\analytics\models.py:137
msgid "量大、強度中等，帶著疲勞在練"
msgstr "High volume, moderate intensity — training is done while carrying fatigue"

#: .\analytics\models.py:138
msgid "數字比高峰期差是正常的；看的是量能不能吃得下、完成率高不高。"
msgstr "Numbers below peak-period levels are normal here; what matters is whether the volume is being absorbed and how high the completion rate is."

#: .\analytics\models.py:141
msgid "量降、強度高，狀態往高峰推"
msgstr "Volume down, intensity up, form being pushed towards a peak"

#: .\analytics\models.py:142
msgid "這裡的數字最接近真實水準，適合拿來當基準。"
msgstr "Numbers here are the closest to true ability, so they make a good baseline."

#: .\analytics\models.py:145
msgid "帶傷或在治療，動作被迫調整"
msgstr "Training while injured or under treatment, with exercises forced to change"

#: .\analytics\models.py:146
msgid "退步幾乎一定跟傷有關，不要當成能力下降；先看傷患頁的疼痛紀錄。"
msgstr "A drop here is almost always the injury rather than a loss of ability; check the pain records on the injury page first."

#: .\analytics\models.py:149
msgid "剛回歸，刻意壓著強度往上疊"
msgstr "Just back, with intensity deliberately held down and built up in stages"

#: .\analytics\models.py:150
msgid "數字偏低是計劃的一部分；看的是有沒有一週比一週好、有沒有再痛。"
msgstr "Low numbers are part of the plan; what matters is whether each week is better than the last and whether the pain comes back."

#: .\analytics\models.py:156
msgid "沒有註記當天的狀態"
msgstr "The state of training that day was not noted"

#: .\analytics\models.py:156
msgid "補上狀態註記，分析才分得清是狀態還是能力。"
msgstr "Add the state note so the analysis can tell a state of training apart from a change in ability."

