msgid "負荷偏高，注意睡眠與恢復，避免連續兩週再加量。"
msgstr ""
"Load is high — watch sleep and recovery, and avoid adding volume two weeks "
"running."

#: .\analytics\services.py:170
msgid "高受傷風險 (ACWR > 1.5)！建議本週減量 20–30%，並加強恢復手段。"
