"練準備／比賽調整／傷害治療／恢復回歸），趨勢才分得清是狀態還是能力。"
msgstr ""
"%(v0)s days / %(v1)s sets have no status filled in. Note the status for "
"those days in the record detail (off-season / preparation / taper / injury "
"treatment / return to training), otherwise the trend cannot tell state apart "
"from ability."

