msgid "。睡眠不足 7 小時的期間，速度與爆發力先掉，不代表能力退步。"
msgstr ""
". In stretches with under 7 hours of sleep, speed and power go first — that "
"is not a loss of ability."

#: .\analytics\services.py:758
msgid "。恢復面看起來沒有明顯拖累。"
msgstr ". Recovery does not look like it is holding anything back."

