msgid ""
"這段期間沒有恢復紀錄（睡眠、痠痛、壓力）。到營養／恢復頁補上，才判斷得出是疲"
"勞還是能力。"
msgstr ""
"There are no recovery records (sleep, soreness, stress) for this period. "
"Fill them in on the Nutrition & Recovery page so fatigue can be told apart "
"from ability."

