msgid "課表完成情況"
msgstr "How the sessions were completed"

#: .\analytics\services.py:778
#, python-format
msgid ""
"有 %(v0)s 組沒有成功完成（完成率 %(v1)s%%）。先確認是開太重／開太快，還是當天"
"狀態就不行。"
msgstr ""
"%(v0)s sets were not completed (%(v1)s%% completion). Check whether it was "
"set too heavy or too fast, or whether the athlete was simply off that day."

#: .\analytics\services.py:789
msgid "強度要求不一致"
msgstr "Required intensity is inconsistent"

#: .\analytics\services.py:790
msgid "這些紀錄混了 "
msgstr "These records mix "

#: .\analytics\services.py:791
msgid " 幾種強度要求。用上面的「分強度」比較，同一檔強度對同一檔強度看才準。"
msgstr ""
" different required intensities. Use \"By intensity\" above so like is "
"compared with like."

#: .\analytics\services.py:803
msgid "休息時間變了"
msgstr "Rest time changed"

#: .\analytics\services.py:804
#, python-format
msgid ""
"前段平均休息 %(v0)s 分、後段 %(v1)s 分。休息縮短本來就會讓數字變差，這是課表"
"設計不是能力變化。"
msgstr ""
"Rest averaged %(v0)s min early on and %(v1)s min later. Shorter rest makes "
"the numbers worse by design — that is programming, not ability."

#: .\analytics\services.py:828
msgid "未分期"
msgstr "Unphased"

#: .\analytics\services.py:848
#, python-format
msgid "%(v0)s 第%(v1)s組"
msgstr "%(v0)s set %(v1)s"

#: .\analytics\services.py:853
