msgid "——這些日子本來就跑不出平常的水準，先把它們排除或分開看，再談進退步。"
msgstr ""
" — on those days the usual level was never on the cards, so set them aside "
"or read them separately before calling it progress or decline."

#: .\analytics\services.py:943
msgid "這段紀錄橫跨 "
msgstr "These records span "

#: .\analytics\services.py:945
msgid " 幾種狀態，各期的訓練目的不同，用上面的「分狀態」比較才對得起來。"
msgstr ""
" different states, each trained for a different purpose; use \"By status\" "
"above to line them up properly."

#: .\analytics\services.py:949
msgid ""
"這些紀錄都沒有註記當天的狀態。先在紀錄明細把狀態補上（季後休息期／訓練準備期"
"／比賽調整期／傷害治療期／恢復回歸期），分析才分得清是狀態造成的還是能力變"
"化。"
msgstr ""
"None of these records say what state the athlete was in. Fill the status in "
"first in the record detail (off-season / preparation / taper / injury "
"treatment / return to training) so the analysis can tell state apart from "
"ability."

#: .\analytics\services.py:954
#, python-format
msgid "每月約 %(v0)s %(v1)s"
msgstr "about %(v0)s %(v1)s per month"

#: .\analytics\services.py:956
msgid "但算不出每月變化（紀錄集中在同一天）"
msgstr ""
"but the monthly rate of change cannot be worked out (the records fall on one "
"day)"

#: .\analytics\services.py:959
#, python-format
msgid "趨勢向好，%(v0)s。"
msgstr "The trend is up, %(v0)s."

#: .\analytics\services.py:961
msgid ""
"在上面的狀態與同期條件都確認過之後，這個進步才算數；確認無誤就維持目前的課表"
"方向，別急著加量。"
msgstr ""
"This counts as progress once the states and conditions above check out; if "
"they do, keep the programme heading the same way and do not rush to add "
"volume."

#: .\analytics\services.py:964
#, python-format
msgid "數字上是退步，%(v0)s。"
msgstr "The numbers are down, %(v0)s."

#: .\analytics\services.py:967
msgid "但同期有"
msgstr "But over the same period there was "

#: .\analytics\services.py:968
msgid ""
"，這種狀態下數字本來就會掉——先當成狀態造成的受限表現，等回到正常訓練狀態再重"
"新取一段來比。"
msgstr ""
", and in that state the numbers drop anyway — treat it as a limited "
"performance and take a fresh stretch to compare once training is back to "
"normal."

#: .\analytics\services.py:972
msgid ""
"先把上面列的因素逐項對過（狀態註記、傷患、ACWR、睡眠、完成率、強度與休息是否"
"一致）——多數情況是累積疲勞或條件改變，全部排除之後才判定是能力下降。"
msgstr ""
"Work through the factors listed above one by one (status notes, injuries, "
"ACWR, sleep, completion rate, and whether intensity and rest were "
"consistent). Most of the time it is accumulated fatigue or changed "
"conditions; only once all of them are ruled out is it a drop in ability."

#: .\analytics\services.py:975
msgid "數值持平。"
msgstr "The numbers are flat."

#: .\analytics\services.py:976
msgid ""
"先確認上面的狀態與條件沒有變；沒有的話，可考慮調整刺激（強度或動作選擇）。"
msgstr ""
"Check first that the states and conditions above have not changed; if they "
"have not, consider changing the stimulus (intensity or exercise choice)."

#: .\analytics\services.py:980
msgid " 另外波動偏大，記錄時記得註明狀態與情境（風速、組次、疲勞度）。"
msgstr ""
" The spread is also wide — note the state and the context (wind, set number, "
"fatigue) when recording."

#: .\analytics\services.py:984
#, python-format
msgid ""
" 有 %(v0)s 組沒有成功完成（完成率 %(v1)s%%），重量或組數可能開太高，下一輪先"
"降 5–10%% 再往上疊。"
msgstr ""
" %(v0)s sets were not completed (%(v1)s%% completion); the weight or the "
"number of sets may be set too high, so drop 5–10%% next round before "
"building back up."

#: .\analytics\services.py:1053 .\analytics\services.py:1212
