#: .\nutrition\services.py:272
#, python-format
msgid ""
"依去脂體重算出的 BMR 是 %(katch)s kcal，比只看體重身高的 %(mifflin)s kcal 高 "
"%(diff)s kcal——肌肉量偏離同體重的平均值，熱量目標可以往這個方向微調。"
msgstr ""
"BMR from lean body mass is %(katch)s kcal, %(diff)s kcal higher than the "
"%(mifflin)s kcal from weight and height alone — muscle mass sits away from "
"the average for this body weight, so the calorie target can be nudged in "
"that direction."

#: .\nutrition\services.py:277
#, python-format
msgid ""
"依去脂體重算出的 BMR 是 %(katch)s kcal，比只看體重身高的 %(mifflin)s kcal 低 "
"%(diff)s kcal——肌肉量偏離同體重的平均值，熱量目標可以往這個方向微調。"
msgstr ""
"BMR from lean body mass is %(katch)s kcal, %(diff)s kcal lower than the "
"%(mifflin)s kcal from weight and height alone — muscle mass sits away from "
"the average for this body weight, so the calorie target can be nudged in "
"that direction."

#: .\nutrition\services.py:293
#, python-format
msgid ""
"今日蛋白目標換算成去脂體重是 %(v0)s g/kg LBM，增肌期建議 2.0-2.4 g/kg LBM，可"
"以再加一點。"
msgstr ""
"Today's protein target works out to %(v0)s g/kg LBM. For a muscle-building "
"phase 2.0-2.4 g/kg LBM is suggested, so there is room to add a little."

#: .\nutrition\services.py:303
#, python-format
msgid ""
"體脂 %(pct).1f%% 高於此性別的競賽參考帶（%(low).0f-%(high).0f%%），減脂請走每"
"週 0.5%% 體重的緩降，別在高強度期做大幅赤字。"
msgstr ""
"Body fat of %(pct).1f%% is above the competitive reference band for this sex "
"(%(low).0f-%(high).0f%%). Come down slowly, about 0.5%% of body weight a "
"week, and do not run a large deficit during a high-intensity phase."

#: .\nutrition\services.py:310
#, python-format
msgid ""
"體脂 %(pct).1f%% 低於參考帶下緣（%(low).0f%%），留意能量供應不足（RED-S）：月"
"經、睡眠、晨脈與骨骼健康都要一起看。"
msgstr ""
"Body fat of %(pct).1f%% is below the bottom of the reference band "
"(%(low).0f%%). Watch for low energy availability (RED-S): menstrual health, "
"sleep, morning heart rate and bone health all have to be read together."

