#, python-format
msgid "（今日訓練 %(v0)s 開始）"
msgstr " (today's session starts at %(v0)s)"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:436
#, python-format
msgid "訓練前 2-3 小時%(v0)s：以碳水為主、低脂低纖的一餐，避免腸胃不適。"
msgstr ""
"2-3 hours before training%(v0)s: a mostly carbohydrate meal, low in fat and "
"fibre, to avoid stomach trouble."

#: .\nutrition\services.py:437
msgid "訓練前 30-60 分鐘：一份好消化的碳水（香蕉、能量棒），不要試新東西。"
msgstr ""
"30-60 minutes before training: one easily digested carbohydrate (a banana, "
"an energy bar) — nothing new on the day."

#: .\nutrition\services.py:438
msgid "訓練中超過 60 分鐘：每小時 30-60 g 碳水 ＋ 含電解質的水。"
msgstr ""
"Sessions over 60 minutes: 30-60 g of carbohydrate per hour plus water with "
"electrolytes."

#: .\nutrition\services.py:439
msgid "訓練後 30-60 分鐘：碳水 1.0-1.2 g/kg ＋ 蛋白 0.3-0.4 g/kg，越早越好。"
msgstr ""
"30-60 minutes after training: 1.0-1.2 g/kg carbohydrate plus 0.3-0.4 g/kg "
"protein, the sooner the better."

#: .\nutrition\services.py:440
msgid "睡前：20-40 g 慢消化蛋白（希臘乳酪、酪蛋白），支撐夜間修復。"
msgstr ""
"Before bed: 20-40 g of slow-digesting protein (Greek yoghurt, casein) to "
"support overnight repair."

#: .\nutrition\services.py:444
msgid "今天沒有排訓練：熱量與碳水本來就該比訓練日低，別硬補到訓練日的量。"
msgstr ""
"No training today: calories and carbohydrate should be lower than on a "
"training day anyway, so do not force them up to training-day levels."

#: .\nutrition\services.py:445
msgid "蛋白質不減：休息日才是肌肉真正修復的時候，維持每餐 0.3-0.4 g/kg。"
msgstr ""
"Protein stays the same: rest days are when muscle actually repairs, so keep "
"0.3-0.4 g/kg at each meal."

